# A change to the agent system's own boundaries must be reviewed by a human.
#
# Agents cannot write these paths at all - `.ai/**` and `.github/**` are in
# agentlib.guard.ALWAYS_FORBIDDEN, and .github/workflows/agent-guard.yml fails
# any agent PR that touches them. This file covers the other direction: a
# HUMAN PR that changes the permission model, the workflows, or the agent
# prompts should not land without a second pair of eyes.
#
# Takes effect only once "Require review from Code Owners" is enabled in branch
# protection for `main` - see .ai/docs/operations.md, "One-time setup".

